# === OPTIONAL — Telegram-only activity channel ===
#
# The activity channel posts agent-to-agent events to a shared Telegram group.
# It's only useful if at least one of your agents uses connector: 'telegram'.
# Skip this entire file if all your agents use connector: 'none'.
#
# Setup: create a Telegram group, add all your agent bots, then fill in:
ACTIVITY_BOT_TOKEN=
ACTIVITY_CHAT_ID=
